This project is a clean modern-Fortran translation of the computational portions
of the R package "slam" version 0.1-56.

Original package authors:
  Kurt Hornik
  David Meyer
  Christian Buchta

Original package license: GPL-2
This translation is distributed under GPL-2.0-only as well.  See COPYING.

The original R package contains R and C implementations.  This translation
preserves the algorithmic intent while replacing R's dynamic/S3 interfaces with
statically typed Fortran APIs.
